extends layout
include partials/schedule

block content
  section.hero.page
    p.eyebrow Established practice, private portfolio
    h1 The buildings we own, and the terms we offer them on.
    p.lede Marchmont holds houses and offices on its own account across #{countryCount} countries. Each one is offered for sale, on a long lease, or on a corporate let, and shown by appointment once a registration has been reviewed.
    .button-row
      a.button(href="/portfolio") View the portfolio
      a.button.button-quiet(href="/register") Register an interest
    dl.index-strip
      div
        dt In the portfolio
        dd= totalCount
      div
        dt Countries
        dd= countryCount
      div
        dt Currencies
        dd= currencyCount
      div
        dt Oldest building
        dd= oldestYear

  section.band.band-rule.page
    .section-head
      div
        p.eyebrow Currently offered
        h2 A working selection
      a(href="/portfolio") See all #{totalCount} offers
    +schedule(featured)

  section.band.band-rule.band-raised
    .page
      .section-head
        div
          p.eyebrow Three ways in
          h2 Buy it, lease it, or take it for a season
      .ways
        article
          span.count= counts.sale
          h3 For sale
          p Freehold and leasehold, houses and whole buildings. Guide price, tenure and chain position are stated on every listing before you ask.
          a(href="/portfolio?type=sale") View properties for sale
        article
          span.count= counts.long_lease
          h3 On long lease
          p Twelve months and up. Rent, deposit, service charge, minimum term and the available from date, all published rather than quoted on request.
          a(href="/portfolio?type=long_lease") View properties to let
        article
          span.count= counts.corporate_let
          h3 Corporate lets
          p One to six months, furnished, for companies moving people between cities. Housekeeping and bills are itemised in the terms.
          a(href="/portfolio?type=corporate_let") View corporate lets

  section.band.band-rule.page
    .policy
      div
        p.eyebrow House policy
        h2 Why we ask before we show
        p.lede Property fraud works because most portals let anyone list and anyone enquire. We do neither. Every building here is ours, and every person we deal with has been reviewed by someone at this office.
      ol.steps
        li
          div
            h3 Register
            p Tell us what you are looking for and where. It takes a few minutes and we read every one.
        li
          div
            h3 We review it
            p Usually within two working days. Once approved you see exact addresses, full terms and the documents behind them.
        li
          div
            h3 View by appointment
            p Someone from this office walks the building with you. Not a call centre, not a lockbox.
        li
          div
            h3 Apply, then pay
            p Money moves only after we have approved your application, for an amount we have set, within a window we have opened. There is no other payment route.

  section.band.band-rule.page
    .stack
      h2 Ready to see the detail
      p.lede Registration takes a few minutes. Approval opens exact addresses, full terms, floor plans and the documents behind each listing.
      .button-row
        a.button(href="/register") Register an interest
        a.button.button-quiet(href="/contact") Speak to someone
